# Gov public archive — whitelist .gitignore
#
# Only source, build files, README documentation, and the license are tracked.
# Everything else (notes, agent bookkeeping, evidence, binaries,
# runtime data, credentials) is ignored by default.

# Ignore everything first, then re-allow the public set.
*
!*/

# This file.
!/.gitignore

# License (MIT, copyright itsiataato — must stay with every fork).
!/LICENSE

# Java source, resources, tests.
!/src/**

# Build files.
!/build.gradle
!/settings.gradle
!/gradle.properties

# Never track client-jar post-processing outputs, configs, or jars —
# even if copied into the tree by accident.
*kbox*
*KBox*
*obf*.jar
tools/*.jar

# Verification/build helper scripts (plain text only — no jars, no caches).
!/tools/*.sh
!/tools/*.mjs
!/tools/*.py
!/tools/README.md

# User-facing documentation.
!/README.md
!/README.part1.md
!/README.part2.md
!/README.part3.md
!/README.part4.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
